{"unit_id":"sensedeal__cue-skills#feature-1","repo":"sensedeal/cue-skills","commit":"0e6b629e98bebef31e63dc3f6dabdd7a0ec1d107","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Cue Skills DSH Bundle 的功能「文档解析」：通过 Omni Reader MCP 解析网页和授权本地文档，并接入 DSH。需配置 Cue API key；OMNI_ALLOWED_ROOTS 控制本地读取目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:23-35"]}
{"unit_id":"sensedeal__cue-skills#feature-2","repo":"sensedeal/cue-skills","commit":"0e6b629e98bebef31e63dc3f6dabdd7a0ec1d107","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Cue Skills DSH Bundle 的功能「Cue 公开数据查询」：将监管、宏观、披露、法律等 Cue 数据域作为 MCP 服务接入 DSH。用户可在会话中调用服务提供的研究数据工具，连接地址按数据域分别配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:36-60","cordis.patch.yml:90-107"]}
{"unit_id":"sensedeal__cue-skills#feature-3","repo":"sensedeal/cue-skills","commit":"0e6b629e98bebef31e63dc3f6dabdd7a0ec1d107","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Cue Skills DSH Bundle 的功能「多数据域接入」：把多个 Cue 公开数据 MCP endpoint 注册到同一 profile，覆盖监管、市场、机构、实体、学术和 IPO 等主题，供 DSH 中的工具调用使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:36-60","cordis.patch.yml:99-160"]}
{"unit_id":"sensedeal__cue-skills#feature-4","repo":"sensedeal/cue-skills","commit":"0e6b629e98bebef31e63dc3f6dabdd7a0ec1d107","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Cue Skills DSH Bundle 的功能「本地读取范围配置」：启动 Omni Reader 时可通过 OMNI_ALLOWED_ROOTS 设置允许访问的目录；未设置时使用 DSH 当前工作目录作为根路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:27-35"]}
